1
00:00:00,638 --> 00:00:02,058
Stop it! Both of you!

2
00:00:02,223 --> 00:00:04,973
(Sheldon:)This fighting, I might as well be back
with my parents.

3
00:00:05,142 --> 00:00:07,892
[AS MOTHER] "I told you if you didn't
quit drinking, I'd leave you."

4
00:00:08,062 --> 00:00:11,812
[AS FATHER] "I guess that makes you a liar.
I'm drunk as hell and you're still here."

5
00:00:12,275 --> 00:00:14,445
[AS MOTHER] "Stop yelling.
You're making Sheldon cry."

6
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:16,700
[AS FATHER]
"I'll tell you what's making Sheldon cry.

7
00:00:16,862 --> 00:00:18,322
That I let you name him Sheldon."

8
00:00:25,329 --> 00:00:28,249
(Howard:)Boy, what got him so upset?

9
00:00:28,416 --> 00:00:31,006
(Raj:)Oh, sure. You can tell
when Sheldon's upset.

10
00:00:38,509 --> 00:00:41,049
(Penny:)Oh. Thank you very much.
Come back soon.

11
00:00:41,887 --> 00:00:44,477
(Penny:)With the other half of my tip.

12
00:00:45,433 --> 00:00:46,563
[SIGHS]

13
00:00:46,726 --> 00:00:49,266
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon.
What're you doing here?

14
00:00:49,437 --> 00:00:51,357
(Sheldon:)This is a restaurant. It's lunchtime.

15
00:00:51,522 --> 00:00:54,402
I'd think as a waitress you'd be familiar
with the paradigm.

16
00:00:54,859 --> 00:00:56,609
(Penny:)-Is Leonard coming?
-No.

17
00:00:56,777 --> 00:01:00,327
(Sheldon:)I believe Leonard is waiting for you
to come back to him and apologize.

